WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 29]

01:43.060 --> 01:45.120
My Lord, please go to Immortal Palace

01:45.259 --> 01:46.620
to open the Four Seasons Monument.

01:46.620 --> 01:48.250
Release the God of the Moonlight,

01:48.250 --> 01:50.050
and undo the curse of our people.

01:50.220 --> 01:52.420
Release the God of the Moonlight!

01:52.620 --> 01:54.460
Undo the curse of our people!

01:55.100 --> 01:56.020
Do you know

01:57.020 --> 01:59.380
that the person under the Four Seasons Monument

01:59.380 --> 02:01.580
has long been corrupted by evil spirit,

02:01.820 --> 02:04.350
and is no longer the pure God of the Moonlight?

02:04.500 --> 02:05.620
Once he comes out,

02:06.140 --> 02:08.460
he will definitely bring chaos to the Three Realms

02:08.460 --> 02:10.120
and kill many innocent lives.

02:10.530 --> 02:12.180
When I was at Immortal Palace,

02:12.180 --> 02:14.110
Supreme God once entered my dream,

02:14.140 --> 02:15.740
and promised to undo the curse of my people

02:15.740 --> 02:17.400
as long as I could release him.

02:17.620 --> 02:18.420
The rest

02:18.860 --> 02:20.260
has nothing to do with us.

02:21.380 --> 02:23.420
My Lord, please go to Immortal Palace

02:23.420 --> 02:24.860
to open the Four Seasons Monument,

02:24.860 --> 02:26.620
Release the God of the Moonlight,

02:26.620 --> 02:28.420
and undo the curse of our people.

02:28.420 --> 02:30.620
Release the God of the Moonlight!

02:30.820 --> 02:32.660
Undo the curse of our people!

02:34.890 --> 02:35.420
Brother.

02:38.100 --> 02:40.360
I'll make my own decision on this matter.

02:40.740 --> 02:42.270
Anyone refuses to accept it

02:43.180 --> 02:44.940
should do his best

02:45.579 --> 02:47.180
to stabilize

02:47.700 --> 02:49.460
the demon world first.

02:52.900 --> 02:53.810
Or

02:54.300 --> 02:56.420
how about extracting your divine spirit

02:56.420 --> 02:59.420
to take out the power of the Demon King in it?

03:02.660 --> 03:04.140
Get out!

03:20.940 --> 03:21.470
Brother.

03:23.540 --> 03:24.140
Brother.

03:26.900 --> 03:28.300
Brother! Brother!

03:34.340 --> 03:35.700
Fortunately.

03:35.810 --> 03:37.670
Although the monument is broken,

03:37.700 --> 03:38.540
there is

03:38.700 --> 03:40.500
no evil spirit escaping from it.

03:40.650 --> 03:41.700
It's hard to say.

03:42.130 --> 03:43.810
What if the evil spirit has escaped from Immortal Palace?

03:43.810 --> 03:46.380
The escaped evil spirit has limited power.

03:46.500 --> 03:49.100
Besides I haven't heard anything about it yet.

03:50.220 --> 03:51.820
News from Marquis Wuyang's Mansion.

03:51.820 --> 03:53.350
The human world is in chaos.

03:53.660 --> 03:54.900
I heard that Demon Palace

03:54.900 --> 03:55.829
is also in chaos.

03:56.579 --> 03:59.780
There may also be someone from the Demons who will take the opportunity to make troubles.

03:59.780 --> 04:01.580
Does the information you mentioned

04:01.580 --> 04:02.420
mean that

04:02.420 --> 04:05.180
the power of that thing under the monument has become stronger?

04:05.180 --> 04:06.040
The evil spirit

04:07.060 --> 04:09.060
originated from the desire in the human heart.

04:09.060 --> 04:11.390
Under the nourishment of the evil spirit,

04:11.530 --> 04:12.900
tiny human desires

04:12.900 --> 04:14.300
can be lured and expanded

04:15.020 --> 04:17.350
and gradually spread in the Three Realms.

04:17.850 --> 04:18.579
That's why

04:19.089 --> 04:20.899
we must protect the Four Seasons Monument,

04:20.899 --> 04:23.560
so that the evil thing has no chance of escaping.

04:24.340 --> 04:28.070
Both worlds of humans and demons have been affected by evil spirit,

04:28.180 --> 04:30.340
why can't there be any evil spirit here?

04:30.340 --> 04:31.260
Could it be

04:31.700 --> 04:33.180
that it turned into a human form

04:33.180 --> 04:34.540
and escaped our pursuit?

04:34.540 --> 04:35.340
Nonsense.

04:35.700 --> 04:36.560
The evil spirit

04:36.659 --> 04:38.420
can only affect the mind of a person.

04:38.420 --> 04:40.100
It cannot turn into human form.

04:40.100 --> 04:42.300
A small amount may not be enough to do so.

04:43.420 --> 04:44.380
But if it is strong enough

04:44.380 --> 04:46.110
to confuse some people's minds

04:46.500 --> 04:48.900
or possess someone whose mind is unstable,

04:48.930 --> 04:50.100
then it is not necessarily so.

04:50.100 --> 04:51.420
You mean...

04:51.580 --> 04:53.740
Pay more attention to the situation in the Three Realms

04:53.740 --> 04:55.340
to avoid further accidents.

05:07.740 --> 05:08.270
Brother.

05:09.500 --> 05:10.460
It's my fault.

05:11.780 --> 05:14.420
I was the one who took away the power of the Demon King,

05:14.420 --> 05:16.950
and joined forces with them to persecute you.

05:18.100 --> 05:19.810
I'm sorry, brother.

05:21.820 --> 05:24.420
You first took away the power of the Demon King,

05:24.420 --> 05:26.970
put we Aquatic Demons in a desperate situation,

05:26.970 --> 05:29.500
and then led them to forcefully persecute me.

05:29.780 --> 05:32.710
Now you are on your knees begging for my forgiveness.

05:33.020 --> 05:33.980
Fu.

05:34.620 --> 05:36.080
In fact, you are expecting

05:36.210 --> 05:37.740
I will definitely forgive you

05:37.740 --> 05:38.900
no matter how sad I am

05:40.180 --> 05:41.540
if you do so,

05:42.090 --> 05:42.860
right?

05:48.980 --> 05:49.580
Yes.

05:50.300 --> 05:51.659
I am too cunning

05:52.020 --> 05:53.020
and too scheming.

05:53.980 --> 05:56.909
But the power of the Demon King has been refined by me.

06:02.690 --> 06:03.300
Now,

06:03.740 --> 06:05.540
I will return the power of the Demon King

06:05.540 --> 06:06.860
together with my divine spirit

06:06.860 --> 06:08.060
to you.

06:10.580 --> 06:11.220
Fu!

06:14.380 --> 06:15.180
Fu!

06:21.220 --> 06:22.260
Don't worry, Fu.

06:22.500 --> 06:23.560
I'll figure it out.

06:30.740 --> 06:32.060
Could you please

06:32.300 --> 06:33.900
undo the curse for my people?

06:34.780 --> 06:37.100
Fu colluded with Bai Feng to cause chaos in Immortal Palace.

06:37.100 --> 06:38.500
Why should I help you?

06:39.940 --> 06:41.470
It seems that you don't care

06:42.020 --> 06:43.620
about Fu's injury.

06:47.450 --> 06:49.020
You probably don't know

06:49.860 --> 06:51.860
that his divine spirit was damaged

06:52.940 --> 06:55.200
because you broke his water energy pill.

06:56.050 --> 06:57.220
In order to save himself,

06:57.220 --> 07:00.300
he took away the power of the Demon King that stabilized the demon world.

07:00.300 --> 07:01.660
It was because of me.

07:03.410 --> 07:04.610
It was not your fault.

07:05.260 --> 07:07.190
It was because Fu was too immature.

07:08.060 --> 07:09.220
I won't force you

07:11.180 --> 07:12.710
if you don't want to help us.

07:23.820 --> 07:24.480
Demon King,

07:24.540 --> 07:25.500
you're late.

07:25.740 --> 07:26.860
Immortal has just left

07:26.860 --> 07:28.590
for Marquis Wuyang's Mansion.

07:31.100 --> 07:32.960
Could it be that Liu Shao is there?

07:34.860 --> 07:36.810
You are too weak to fight me.

07:37.340 --> 07:38.540
Don't be afraid of her.

07:38.540 --> 07:40.470
We have the Protection Spell here.

07:41.300 --> 07:43.580
Is that all you have got?

07:44.140 --> 07:45.980
When I was a senior here,

07:45.980 --> 07:47.440
you didn't even exist yet.

07:52.100 --> 07:52.630
Bai Feng.

07:52.740 --> 07:53.620
How dare you!

07:55.090 --> 07:56.460
You are really here.

08:00.060 --> 08:00.820
Liu Shao.

08:01.300 --> 08:03.180
I didn't expect that you could also become a disciple here.

08:03.180 --> 08:04.500
I was the one who didn't expect

08:04.500 --> 08:05.740
you to still be so rampant.

08:05.740 --> 08:07.980
Haven't you been punished enough by Immortal Palace?

08:07.980 --> 08:11.040
Don't count on anyone from Immortal Palace to save you.

08:12.330 --> 08:14.620
They are all hypocrites.

08:15.250 --> 08:16.900
You all will die today!

08:17.180 --> 08:18.260
I beat you once.

08:18.900 --> 08:19.960
I can still beat you

08:20.060 --> 08:21.460
today.

08:21.570 --> 08:24.030
You're still talking nonsense, aren’t you?

08:24.580 --> 08:25.260
Senior,

08:25.330 --> 08:26.980
with the Protection Spell here, we don’t need to be afraid of this evil woman.

08:26.980 --> 08:27.650
Really?

08:38.100 --> 08:38.700
Damn.

08:38.820 --> 08:40.870
Senior Liu Shao was taken out of the Protection Spell by that whirlwind.

08:40.870 --> 08:45.240
[Marquis Wuyang's Mansion]

08:47.300 --> 08:47.900
Bai Feng!

08:49.020 --> 08:51.480
What else can you do besides playing tricks?

08:51.740 --> 08:52.870
Everyone hates you.

08:53.090 --> 08:54.490
And you live like a demon!

09:02.180 --> 09:03.110
You used poison?

09:03.780 --> 09:04.210
No.

09:04.850 --> 09:06.110
It's not demon poison.

09:06.330 --> 09:07.130
You're right.

09:07.570 --> 09:08.830
It's not demon poison.

09:09.060 --> 09:11.720
But it's a poison that even Immortal is in awe of.

09:27.460 --> 09:29.060
Why would you still protect her?

09:29.060 --> 09:30.380
Why?

09:48.060 --> 09:48.820
Brother.

09:48.980 --> 09:49.660
Demon King.

09:49.900 --> 09:51.620
It was here that Liu Shao was plotted against by Bai Feng

09:51.620 --> 09:52.620
and disappeared.

09:52.620 --> 09:53.880
It was Illusion Spell.

09:54.180 --> 09:56.330
The moment I broke through the illusion,

09:56.330 --> 09:57.860
Bai Feng took Liu Shao away.

09:58.060 --> 09:58.580
Luo Ge.

09:59.140 --> 10:00.740
Use the Moon Bell to find her.

10:08.060 --> 10:09.920
Bai Feng knew Moon Bell very well,

10:10.460 --> 10:12.860
so she cut off my connection with that bell.

10:14.660 --> 10:15.220
Luo Ge,

10:15.420 --> 10:16.480
you are exhausted.

10:16.620 --> 10:17.460
Take a rest first.

10:17.460 --> 10:18.390
I'll go find her.

10:20.300 --> 10:21.160
Let's split up.

10:21.900 --> 10:22.380
Luo Ge.

10:22.500 --> 10:23.030
Brother!

10:25.420 --> 10:26.170
I'll go too.

10:26.460 --> 10:27.940
You guys can look around as well.

10:27.940 --> 10:28.270
Okay.

10:30.660 --> 10:32.420
[Marquis Wuyang's Mansion]

10:42.970 --> 10:44.860
Fu's divine spirit was damaged

10:45.940 --> 10:48.200
because you broke his water energy pill.

10:48.900 --> 10:51.230
Why would I still worry about that bad guy?

10:57.580 --> 10:58.500
Let me help you.

11:03.020 --> 11:05.020
Without the power of the Demon King,

11:05.620 --> 11:07.680
they would be thrown out of the water.

11:08.300 --> 11:09.830
People from Aquatic Demons

11:10.260 --> 11:11.320
do die out of water.

11:34.300 --> 11:34.830
Luo Ning.

11:37.700 --> 11:38.230
Luo Ning!

12:02.460 --> 12:03.540
Did you intend

12:03.620 --> 12:05.220
to kill her just now?

12:07.460 --> 12:08.460
General Fu,

12:08.940 --> 12:11.100
only the demon power of Demon King in White

12:11.100 --> 12:12.380
can barely maintain the stability

12:12.380 --> 12:13.580
of Demon Palace now.

12:13.580 --> 12:15.460
People from Aquatic Demons are thrown out of the water frequently.

12:15.460 --> 12:17.380
And there are often demons with malicious intentions outside

12:17.380 --> 12:19.910
waiting to take demon energy from our people.

12:20.060 --> 12:21.930
I had to set a lot of traps around.

12:21.930 --> 12:24.500
But I didn't expect them to hurt Fairy Luo Ning.

12:24.500 --> 12:25.300
This...

12:26.770 --> 12:28.010
I made it very clear

12:28.010 --> 12:29.740
the day my divine spirit was wounded

12:29.740 --> 12:31.260
that I had done so many things

12:31.260 --> 12:33.020
just to keep her by my side.

12:33.180 --> 12:33.980
From now on,

12:34.700 --> 12:36.630
none of you are allowed to hurt her.

12:39.100 --> 12:39.700
Yes.

12:40.940 --> 12:41.580
Luo Ning.

12:41.890 --> 12:42.890
Have a good sleep.

12:43.460 --> 12:44.660
When I finish my work,

12:44.900 --> 12:46.030
you will understand

12:46.140 --> 12:47.940
that you can only stay by my side.

13:09.210 --> 13:10.180
Well done.

13:11.220 --> 13:12.860
I didn't save your life

13:13.700 --> 13:15.560
and try so hard to heal you in vain.

13:15.900 --> 13:17.220
I want to kill her.

13:19.340 --> 13:20.300
Keeping her

13:21.300 --> 13:23.100
is more useful than killing her.

13:33.060 --> 13:33.940
What is this?

13:38.740 --> 13:39.940
A thousand years ago,

13:40.700 --> 13:42.220
Xie Lingqi secretly

13:42.740 --> 13:44.620
brought this Poisonous Incense out

13:44.620 --> 13:47.620
from Yin-yang Cave without telling Immortal Palace.

13:48.460 --> 13:49.590
Poisonous Incense?

13:49.780 --> 13:51.420
Those who smelled this incense

13:51.420 --> 13:54.350
would not be able to activate their spiritual veins,

13:54.380 --> 13:56.460
and would lose their minds

13:57.020 --> 13:59.210
to become demons after a period of time.

13:59.210 --> 14:00.340
I'd like to see

14:01.060 --> 14:02.500
if Luo Ge

14:02.740 --> 14:04.260
is willing to kill her

14:04.620 --> 14:06.020
by then.

14:20.820 --> 14:22.900
Send her back to Luo Ge?

14:23.500 --> 14:24.620
I won't do that.

14:25.690 --> 14:29.620
Liu Shao, I will torture you to death.

14:32.100 --> 14:32.700
Bai Feng?

14:37.540 --> 14:38.070
Liu Shao.

14:39.820 --> 14:40.350
Liu Shao.

14:41.100 --> 14:41.650
Liu Shao!

14:56.380 --> 14:56.910
Liu Shao.

14:59.580 --> 15:00.110
Liu Shao.

15:04.770 --> 15:05.230
Come on.

15:09.060 --> 15:09.780
He Na?

15:10.580 --> 15:11.820
Why am I here?

15:12.580 --> 15:14.140
You were kidnapped by Bai Feng

15:14.140 --> 15:15.740
and poisoned by Moon Poison.

15:16.940 --> 15:18.540
Luo Ge and I have been looking for you.

15:18.540 --> 15:19.600
I've found you now,

15:21.220 --> 15:22.740
and I have notified Immortal Palace.

15:22.740 --> 15:24.200
Just take some rest first.

15:24.500 --> 15:25.420
Will I be fine?

15:25.540 --> 15:27.540
Moon Poison is extremely poisonous

15:28.090 --> 15:30.820
and comes from Yin-yang Cave in Immortal Palace.

15:30.980 --> 15:33.840
But the cave has been closed for thousands of years.

15:34.810 --> 15:36.780
I don't know who brought this poison out,

15:36.780 --> 15:38.710
and why it was obtained by Bai Feng.

15:53.260 --> 15:54.920
I can't use my spiritual power

15:55.260 --> 15:56.980
right now.

15:58.260 --> 16:00.120
Is it because of this Moon Poison?

16:02.530 --> 16:03.260
Don't worry.

16:04.100 --> 16:05.620
Sun Spring in Yin-yang Cave

16:05.620 --> 16:06.820
can cure this poison.

16:07.300 --> 16:07.940
Besides,

16:08.420 --> 16:10.060
Moon Poison has no effect

16:10.500 --> 16:12.430
on the people from Aquatic Demons.

16:13.100 --> 16:13.580
No.

16:14.940 --> 16:16.670
I can't implicate you anymore.

16:17.420 --> 16:18.900
It is me who should go,

16:19.180 --> 16:20.100
not you.

16:21.540 --> 16:22.140
Or

16:23.130 --> 16:23.940
how about

16:24.420 --> 16:25.350
I take you there?

16:35.180 --> 16:36.020
Liu Shao.

16:37.540 --> 16:38.500
Where are you?

16:39.380 --> 16:39.980
Luo Ge!

16:41.300 --> 16:41.780
Luo Ge.

16:42.300 --> 16:44.160
Liu Shao has been rescued by He Na.

16:44.260 --> 16:44.940
But

16:45.620 --> 16:47.420
she was poisoned by Moon Poison.

16:48.220 --> 16:49.220
Moon Poison?

16:50.340 --> 16:52.470
That's something from Yin-yang Cave.

16:52.900 --> 16:54.630
I could only think of Xie Lingqi

16:54.650 --> 16:55.620
who would own it

16:56.060 --> 16:57.790
in the entire Immortal Palace.

17:02.100 --> 17:02.780
Yes.

17:03.100 --> 17:04.960
Moon Poison was given to him by me.

17:05.460 --> 17:08.260
He promised me to reopen Yin-yang Cave.

17:08.460 --> 17:10.220
But I don't know

17:10.339 --> 17:11.700
who he gave it to.

17:13.060 --> 17:14.170
You don't have to ask him.

17:14.170 --> 17:16.770
Why don't we just go to Yin-yang Cave to find it?

17:17.420 --> 17:18.339
Speaking of it,

17:18.810 --> 17:21.099
Lord Shang wanted to open Xilun Formation back then,

17:19.520 --> 17:22.000
[Yin-yang Cave]

17:21.619 --> 17:24.660
but was afraid that he would be turned into stone by the backlash of the formation.

17:24.660 --> 17:26.260
So he was as anxious as you are

17:26.339 --> 17:28.470
to find Sun Spring to protect himself.

17:30.140 --> 17:31.600
But have you ever wondered

17:32.180 --> 17:34.180
why Lord Shang

17:34.620 --> 17:36.280
would have let us take the risk

17:36.540 --> 17:38.540
if Sun Spring was so easy to get?

17:42.460 --> 17:44.820
Liu Shao, we must get out as soon as possible.

17:44.820 --> 17:46.280
Is there something wrong?

17:46.580 --> 17:47.540
I'm not sure.

17:48.650 --> 17:50.250
It's just that this boundary

17:50.260 --> 17:51.990
seems to have a seriou problem.

17:52.300 --> 17:53.500
A seriou problem?

17:53.900 --> 17:54.930
But it was pretty easy

17:54.930 --> 17:57.540
when I just came in.

17:59.860 --> 18:04.180
The boundary at the entrance was set up by Immortal Palace a thousand years ago.

18:04.180 --> 18:05.700
But I felt Sun's aura

18:06.140 --> 18:08.460
on that boundary.

18:09.450 --> 18:13.380
So this boundary was once set by God of the Sun?

18:14.180 --> 18:16.780
The boundary set by the Immortal Palace was easy to open,

18:16.780 --> 18:18.690
but I'm worried that when we try to get out later...

18:18.690 --> 18:21.420
I'm afraid it's easy to get in this Yin-yang Cave,

18:21.850 --> 18:24.660
but it won't be so easy to get out.

18:25.300 --> 18:26.580
It is said that ten thousand years ago,

18:26.580 --> 18:29.260
God of the Sun cleaned up the evil spirit in Yin-yang Cave,

18:29.260 --> 18:32.260
and the remaining impurities turned into Sun Spring and Moon Poison.

18:32.260 --> 18:34.420
And he set a boundary here.

18:35.580 --> 18:37.660
Anyway, we have to find Sun Spring

18:37.980 --> 18:39.240
to detoxify you first.

18:42.140 --> 18:44.220
Back then Lord Shang refused to go in

18:45.020 --> 18:47.300
because he was afraid that he wouldn't be able to get out.

18:47.300 --> 18:48.860
My dad was not such a timid person.

18:48.860 --> 18:50.210
He was busy stabilizing the Four Seasons Monument,

18:50.210 --> 18:51.300
and couldn't come in person,

18:51.300 --> 18:52.620
so he asked you to get Sun Spring.

18:52.620 --> 18:53.570
You are so naive.

18:54.780 --> 18:55.900
You didn't know

18:56.290 --> 18:57.770
where the cave's exit was,

18:59.020 --> 19:00.740
so your father barely opened a crack

19:00.740 --> 19:02.140
on Sun Boundary.

19:02.660 --> 19:03.740
But there was

19:05.130 --> 19:07.420
more than just Sun Boundary in this cave,

19:07.900 --> 19:10.820
but also the Moon Poison formed by the hatred of the two gods.

19:10.820 --> 19:13.300
As long as someone touched Sun Spring,

19:13.500 --> 19:16.340
Moon Poison would come out with it.

19:16.780 --> 19:20.140
And inhaling this poison would cause you to lose your mind

19:20.660 --> 19:23.220
and become a demon who only knows killing.

19:25.380 --> 19:27.460
In order to get Sun Spring,

19:27.940 --> 19:29.340
your father, Lord Shang,

19:29.660 --> 19:33.780
did not hesitate to let the disciples of the three palaces enter here in batches.

19:33.780 --> 19:35.420
I was prepared back then.

19:35.820 --> 19:37.620
So I brought Moon Poison and Sun Spring

19:37.620 --> 19:39.980
to get out before the crack closed.

19:43.740 --> 19:45.860
Moon Poison is too dangerous. I'll keep it.

19:45.860 --> 19:48.340
You've been poisoned. Take Sun Spring with you.

19:48.340 --> 19:49.250
If I can't get out,

19:48.910 --> 19:50.550
[Xie Lingqi's Junior Sister, Wu Shiwei]

19:49.380 --> 19:50.910
you can detoxify yourself.

20:02.820 --> 20:03.460
Shiwei!

20:04.460 --> 20:06.020
Shiwei. Shiwei.

20:16.700 --> 20:17.300
Shiwei!

20:18.420 --> 20:19.740
Shiwei! Shiwei!

20:19.860 --> 20:20.770
Let me carry you.

20:20.770 --> 20:21.420
You go first.

20:21.420 --> 20:22.380
Leave me alone. You go first.

20:22.380 --> 20:23.100
It's too late.

20:23.100 --> 20:24.260
I won't leave you here.

20:24.260 --> 20:24.860
Let's go together.

20:24.860 --> 20:25.780
Just leave!

20:31.780 --> 20:32.420
Shiwei!

20:33.500 --> 20:34.140
Shiwei!

20:39.420 --> 20:40.020
Shiwei?

20:40.180 --> 20:41.020
Why?

20:43.860 --> 20:44.540
Senior.

20:46.020 --> 20:46.620
Shiwei...

20:47.180 --> 20:47.580
You...

20:48.140 --> 20:49.620
I can't go

20:50.170 --> 20:51.380
without Sun Spring.

20:52.050 --> 20:52.490
No.

20:53.330 --> 20:53.860
No.

20:54.700 --> 20:56.700
I'll stay here to look for Sun Spring

20:57.700 --> 20:59.630
and wait for you to come and save me.

21:00.220 --> 21:00.740
No.

21:02.020 --> 21:03.180
Shiwei.

21:04.050 --> 21:04.620
Shiwei.

21:05.900 --> 21:07.140
I escaped.

21:08.220 --> 21:09.340
But the others

21:10.060 --> 21:11.170
were trapped there

21:12.620 --> 21:14.220
forever.

21:15.620 --> 21:16.680
Among those people

21:16.980 --> 21:18.380
were my fellow disciples,

21:18.380 --> 21:19.500
my best friend,

21:20.210 --> 21:20.940
and

21:21.300 --> 21:22.620
my junior sister.

21:24.460 --> 21:27.320
Yin-yang Cave was filled with the helpless despair

21:27.460 --> 21:30.420
and the pain of being unable to escape.

21:30.980 --> 21:33.620
So there spawned countless evil spirits.

21:34.060 --> 21:36.020
The Four Seasons Monument has also become unstable because of this.

21:36.020 --> 21:38.540
So Lord Shang had to seal it.

21:40.860 --> 21:41.620
No one...

21:42.620 --> 21:44.880
No one was there to save my junior sister.

21:45.740 --> 21:47.820
No one was there to save Shiwei.

21:52.100 --> 21:53.700
You want to save Wu Shiwei?

21:54.580 --> 21:55.380
Yes!

21:56.300 --> 21:58.100
I'm going to open Yin-yang Cave

21:58.540 --> 22:00.100
to save her.

22:01.140 --> 22:02.740
It has been a thousand years.

22:03.820 --> 22:06.480
She has been waiting for me for a thousand years.

22:10.260 --> 22:11.050
Luo Ge!

22:12.020 --> 22:13.100
Take me with you!

22:14.100 --> 22:15.760
Aren't you going to punish me?

22:16.530 --> 22:18.390
Take me to Yin-yang Cave with you.

22:18.500 --> 22:19.660
Even if I have to die,

22:21.860 --> 22:24.380
I want to be with Shiwei.

22:26.410 --> 22:28.470
You didn't melt in Bone Melting Pool,

22:28.660 --> 22:31.320
so you're a kind person and don't deserve to die.

22:31.540 --> 22:33.600
You don't have to go to Yin-yang Cave.

22:34.300 --> 22:35.260
I am the only one who knows where the crack is

22:35.260 --> 22:36.990
in the entire Immortal Palace.

22:37.900 --> 22:39.760
I was the only survivor back then.

22:39.900 --> 22:41.060
No one can take you out

22:41.060 --> 22:42.570
except me.

22:43.900 --> 22:45.030
Time is running out.

22:46.140 --> 22:48.450
Just take me there

22:49.620 --> 22:52.020
if you don't want Liu Shao to become a demon.

22:59.260 --> 22:59.860
How do you feel?

22:59.860 --> 23:00.620
Are you okay?

23:01.100 --> 23:03.030
With your water energy and elixir,

23:04.420 --> 23:05.550
I'm much better now.

23:26.060 --> 23:26.820
This is...

23:30.380 --> 23:31.040
Be careful.

23:38.100 --> 23:39.100
It is Moon Poison.

23:39.220 --> 23:40.820
It comes out with Sun Spring.

23:44.420 --> 23:45.420
He Na, be careful!

23:51.420 --> 23:52.100
He Na!

23:53.980 --> 23:54.540
He Na.

23:55.420 --> 23:56.020
He Na.

23:56.220 --> 23:56.680
Come on.

24:04.090 --> 24:04.750
Be careful.

24:13.140 --> 24:13.860
What?

24:14.220 --> 24:16.080
My brother went to Yin-yang Cave?

24:16.460 --> 24:17.700
He could only go there

24:17.700 --> 24:19.780
if he wanted to save Miss Liu.

24:21.220 --> 24:23.820
But how could Liu Shao be rescued by my brother?

24:24.860 --> 24:25.860
Shouldn't she...

24:33.930 --> 24:34.730
You're awake.

24:36.980 --> 24:38.260
Where are you going?

24:39.500 --> 24:41.030
Lie down and take some rest.

24:41.500 --> 24:42.420
Leave me alone.

24:43.170 --> 24:44.580
If I didn't take care of you,

24:44.580 --> 24:46.980
would you still be here and be angry with me?

24:47.540 --> 24:49.540
Didn't you say that you don't want to see me for the rest of your life?

24:49.540 --> 24:51.670
Didn't you crush my water energy pill?

24:52.540 --> 24:54.070
Why did you come here again?

24:55.060 --> 24:56.500
I just wanted to see

24:56.900 --> 24:58.660
how serious your injuries are,

24:58.980 --> 25:01.780
which caused you to take the power of the Demon King

25:02.730 --> 25:05.130
at the risk of destroying your entire race.

25:06.620 --> 25:07.500
So

25:09.620 --> 25:10.690
you came to see me

25:10.860 --> 25:11.700
because you were worried about me,

25:11.700 --> 25:12.170
right?

25:12.860 --> 25:14.490
I am not worried about you.

25:16.020 --> 25:17.900
You almost killed Liu Shao and my brother

25:17.900 --> 25:20.100
with the power of the water spirit bead.

25:20.660 --> 25:21.920
So even if you got hurt,

25:22.020 --> 25:23.300
you deserved it.

25:24.740 --> 25:25.180
Yes.

25:27.620 --> 25:28.750
I shouldn't have...

25:30.220 --> 25:32.080
I shouldn't have hurt your family

25:32.330 --> 25:33.860
and your fellow disciples.

25:34.450 --> 25:35.820
Even if I would die from serious injuries,

25:35.820 --> 25:36.900
I deserved it.

25:43.050 --> 25:44.380
I... I saw

25:45.570 --> 25:47.460
one of your people

25:48.580 --> 25:50.380
die in front of me just like that.

25:54.900 --> 25:55.940
Over the years,

25:56.460 --> 25:58.220
I have seen too many of our people

25:58.220 --> 25:59.250
choose to end their lives

25:59.250 --> 26:01.180
because they could not bear the torture

26:01.180 --> 26:02.500
of staying here.

26:04.540 --> 26:06.260
That's why I did the wrong thing

26:06.260 --> 26:07.260
that made you sad.

26:07.860 --> 26:09.300
I won't do this again.

26:18.740 --> 26:19.540
Shiwei.

26:20.260 --> 26:21.180
Shiwei!

26:25.260 --> 26:25.820
Shiwei.

26:30.330 --> 26:31.500
Shiwei!

26:32.060 --> 26:32.820
He Na!

26:34.460 --> 26:35.060
Liu Shao?

26:39.020 --> 26:40.010
Go, He Na.

26:40.380 --> 26:41.180
Leave me here.

26:41.660 --> 26:42.740
These disciples

26:42.860 --> 26:43.780
have lost their minds.

26:43.780 --> 26:45.180
We can't beat them.

26:45.300 --> 26:46.860
I won't leave you alone.

26:50.340 --> 26:51.400
He Na, your hand...

26:53.420 --> 26:54.460
I always thought

26:55.260 --> 26:58.120
that if I become stronger, I won't drag anyone down.

26:59.820 --> 27:01.420
But I still dragged you down.

27:02.780 --> 27:03.330
Liu Shao.

27:04.260 --> 27:06.120
I never thought you were a burden.

27:07.460 --> 27:08.990
If I could die here with you,

27:09.900 --> 27:12.360
maybe it would be another kind of fate for us.

27:13.140 --> 27:16.020
Remember the Water Hyacinth jade pendant I gave you?

27:16.020 --> 27:16.620
Actually,

27:18.140 --> 27:20.540
that was what I prepared for my Demon Queen.

27:27.100 --> 27:27.690
He Na...

27:34.620 --> 27:35.180
He Na!

27:51.780 --> 27:52.300
Luo Ge?

28:02.420 --> 28:04.890
He had spent a lot of thought on the Four Seasons Monument,

28:04.890 --> 28:06.690
and now he went to Yin-yang Cave.

28:06.820 --> 28:07.940
He got into so much trouble

28:07.940 --> 28:09.090
because of Liu Shao.

28:09.500 --> 28:10.420
If this continues,

28:10.420 --> 28:12.220
when will Ge become Supreme God?

28:12.580 --> 28:14.220
He only cares about Liu Shao

28:14.220 --> 28:14.940
and He Na,

28:15.170 --> 28:16.900
not the Three Realms at all.

28:17.420 --> 28:18.300
Immortal Master,

28:18.300 --> 28:19.940
it's not appropriate for you to say so.

28:19.940 --> 28:21.620
If he hadn't helped stabilize the demon world,

28:21.620 --> 28:22.820
the chaos in the demon world

28:22.820 --> 28:24.500
would have affected the Three Realms.

28:24.500 --> 28:26.230
Then what about Yin-yang Cave?

28:26.620 --> 28:28.080
Is that where he should go?

28:28.210 --> 28:29.610
What do you want him to do?

28:29.740 --> 28:30.500
Do you want him to watch

28:30.500 --> 28:31.940
his beloved die?

28:33.580 --> 28:35.500
I did it for his own good.

28:36.500 --> 28:37.220
You

28:37.380 --> 28:38.660
can't do anything else

28:38.900 --> 28:39.980
but help him.

28:41.660 --> 28:42.220
Senior.

28:50.740 --> 28:51.420
Master Shang.

28:51.420 --> 28:52.220
Why did they

28:52.220 --> 28:53.580
go to Yin-yang Cave?

28:55.820 --> 28:56.420
What?

28:56.740 --> 28:59.020
Both my brother and your brother entered Yin-yang Cave?

28:59.020 --> 28:59.460
Yes.

28:59.980 --> 29:01.380
It is said that strange things

29:01.380 --> 29:03.040
will happen in Yin-yang Cave.

29:04.140 --> 29:05.580
After my brother entered,

29:05.580 --> 29:07.460
I tried to contact him

29:07.460 --> 29:08.940
with our Demon Palace's unique spell.

29:08.940 --> 29:09.540
But

29:10.820 --> 29:12.080
he never replied to me.

29:12.900 --> 29:13.940
In that case,

29:14.300 --> 29:16.100
could they already be in danger?

29:16.330 --> 29:17.860
If he hadn't been in danger,

29:18.210 --> 29:19.460
he would have replied to me

29:19.460 --> 29:21.520
knowing that I was worried about him.

29:25.380 --> 29:26.440
Are you going back?

29:27.340 --> 29:28.260
You can

29:28.500 --> 29:29.260
at least know their situation

29:29.260 --> 29:31.260
as soon as possible if you stay here.

29:34.060 --> 29:35.580
I'm going to wait until dawn.

29:35.580 --> 29:37.440
If he hasn't replied to me by then,

29:37.460 --> 29:38.790
I'll go in and save them.

29:40.940 --> 29:42.740
If my brother and your brother teamed up

29:42.740 --> 29:44.620
and still encountered big trouble inside,

29:44.620 --> 29:46.550
it would be useless for you to go in.

29:48.740 --> 29:50.000
He is my elder brother,

29:50.460 --> 29:51.860
the Demon King of my race.

29:52.220 --> 29:53.500
Even if I die inside,

29:53.860 --> 29:55.190
he has to come out alive.

29:55.460 --> 29:57.190
You should understand, right?

30:00.780 --> 30:02.380
Then I'll wait here with you.

30:03.170 --> 30:05.570
If there is no messages from them tomorrow,

30:06.100 --> 30:08.100
I will enter Yin-yang Cave with you.

30:14.020 --> 30:14.580
He Na.

30:16.620 --> 30:17.140
Luo Ge.

30:18.090 --> 30:19.940
I thought I could bring Liu Shao here

30:19.940 --> 30:20.870
to detoxify her.

30:21.450 --> 30:22.900
But my Water Shield

30:23.900 --> 30:25.500
didn't work here.

30:26.140 --> 30:27.130
The forbidden spell was set by God of the Sun

30:27.130 --> 30:29.020
ten thousand years ago.

30:29.500 --> 30:31.330
Not to mention your Water Shield,

30:31.330 --> 30:32.500
even Luo Ge's

30:32.780 --> 30:33.700
Lotus Spell

30:33.860 --> 30:34.920
can't be cast here.

30:35.220 --> 30:36.480
You shouldn't be here.

30:43.340 --> 30:44.500
I gave you Moon Bell

30:45.260 --> 30:46.790
just to know if you are safe.

30:47.660 --> 30:49.190
You can give it back to me now

30:49.380 --> 30:50.580
if you don't want me to care about you.

30:50.580 --> 30:51.540
You already gave it to me.

30:51.540 --> 30:52.940
How can you take it back?

30:55.380 --> 30:56.460
I thought you didn't want it.

30:56.460 --> 30:58.020
Of course I want it.

31:00.100 --> 31:01.260
Stop it.

31:03.460 --> 31:04.660
I'm going to heal you.

31:21.260 --> 31:22.300
Shiwei.

31:23.260 --> 31:25.060
I will definitely bring you home

31:25.330 --> 31:26.940
wherever you are.

31:41.020 --> 31:41.580
Fu.

31:42.260 --> 31:43.610
Liu Shao has already met me,

31:43.610 --> 31:44.500
so did Luo Ge,

31:44.780 --> 31:45.640
so don't worry.

31:56.340 --> 31:56.940
What's wrong?

31:56.940 --> 31:57.740
Any news?

31:59.180 --> 31:59.710
Liu Shao,

31:59.820 --> 32:00.380
your brother

32:00.380 --> 32:01.780
and my brother have already met up.

32:01.780 --> 32:03.310
They should be safe for now.

32:04.180 --> 32:05.640
They haven't come out yet?

32:08.380 --> 32:10.710
It seems that this matter is a bit strange.

32:12.740 --> 32:13.380
But

32:13.980 --> 32:15.540
if the problem could not be solved

32:15.540 --> 32:17.020
when your brother and my brother have joined forces,

32:17.020 --> 32:18.020
it shoule not be solved

32:18.020 --> 32:19.620
by anyone else in this world.

32:21.700 --> 32:22.660
That's true.

32:25.780 --> 32:28.310
Would you like to go to bed and rest for a while?

32:28.500 --> 32:29.300
No need.

32:29.380 --> 32:30.620
I'll just wait them here.

32:30.620 --> 32:32.350
Let me know if you have any news.

32:32.940 --> 32:34.940
Or do you need me to make perfume with you?

32:34.940 --> 32:35.930
Don't bother.

32:36.100 --> 32:36.980
Go ahead with your business.

32:36.980 --> 32:38.060
I'll do it myself.

33:29.740 --> 33:30.700
Fu...

33:36.140 --> 33:36.700
Luo Ning,

33:38.620 --> 33:39.880
please don't leave me,

33:40.210 --> 33:40.850
okay?

33:51.020 --> 33:54.180
The Life Gate of the Four Seasons Monument is connected to Bone Melting Pool,

33:54.180 --> 33:56.910
and its Death Gate is connected to Yin-yang Cave.

33:57.980 --> 34:00.260
Thousands of years of resentment have accumulated here.

34:00.260 --> 34:01.590
If we enter it suddenly,

34:01.650 --> 34:05.260
it will definitely trigger the evil spirit fluctuations of the demonized disciples,

34:05.260 --> 34:06.050
causing

34:06.580 --> 34:08.980
Four Seasons Monument to become unstable.

34:10.620 --> 34:11.280
Therefore,

34:11.780 --> 34:13.980
we have to cast spells and get Sun Spring as soon as possible.

34:13.980 --> 34:15.380
And we need a guard.

34:15.900 --> 34:16.900
Otherwise...

34:20.179 --> 34:21.100
I knew it.

34:22.420 --> 34:23.219
You stay here.

34:23.500 --> 34:25.030
I'm going to distract them.

34:28.580 --> 34:29.170
He Na.

34:29.460 --> 34:30.460
Go get Sun Spring.

34:30.739 --> 34:31.400
Xie Lingqi,

34:31.540 --> 34:32.540
protect Liu Shao.

34:33.620 --> 34:34.380
Follow me

34:34.580 --> 34:35.840
if you want Sun Spring.

34:37.500 --> 34:38.179
Luo Ge!

34:38.580 --> 34:39.110
Liu Shao!

34:39.699 --> 34:40.230
Liu Shao!

34:40.380 --> 34:41.260
Luo Ge's spiritual power is superb,

34:41.260 --> 34:42.260
he should be fine.

34:55.380 --> 34:56.060
Be careful!

35:13.820 --> 35:14.420
You are...

35:24.380 --> 35:25.100
Xie Lingqi!

35:29.140 --> 35:30.260
Shiwei!

35:39.900 --> 35:41.500
It has been a thousand years.

35:42.500 --> 35:43.830
I'm here to save you now.

35:44.810 --> 35:46.260
I'll take you back.

35:48.220 --> 35:49.480
I won't leave you here.

35:49.650 --> 35:50.100
Let's go together.

35:50.100 --> 35:50.890
Hurry up!

35:51.740 --> 35:53.260
I'll stay here looking for Sun Spring,

35:53.260 --> 35:54.780
and wait for you to come and save me.

35:54.780 --> 35:55.300
Shiwei!

35:58.580 --> 35:59.060
No.

35:59.860 --> 36:00.340
No.

36:01.380 --> 36:02.340
My surname is Xie.

36:02.340 --> 36:03.820
-I'm your senior. -Shiwei. Shiwei will come back.

36:03.820 --> 36:04.820
What a nice name.

36:09.460 --> 36:10.740
We once agreed

36:11.900 --> 36:13.230
that I would get you out.

36:18.010 --> 36:19.470
Sorry to keep you waiting.

36:20.530 --> 36:21.340
I'm

36:23.020 --> 36:24.730
waiting for someone.

36:26.140 --> 36:26.900
Wu Shiwei

36:28.700 --> 36:30.610
is waiting for Xie Lingqi.

36:43.850 --> 36:44.890
Shiwei.

36:47.260 --> 36:48.300
Sorry.

36:49.700 --> 36:50.740
I'm late.

36:53.500 --> 36:55.100
It has been a thousand years.

36:56.380 --> 36:58.220
You have suffered too much.

37:01.620 --> 37:02.820
Shiwei.

37:06.180 --> 37:07.260
Let's go home.

37:08.980 --> 37:11.060
I'll take you home, okay?

37:12.300 --> 37:13.300
Shiwei.

37:14.860 --> 37:16.060
Shiwei, look at me.

37:17.740 --> 37:19.100
I'm Xie Lingqi,

37:20.660 --> 37:23.340
the one who promised to protect you forever.

37:25.700 --> 37:27.100
Do you remember?

37:29.260 --> 37:31.520
You said you would wait for me to save you.

37:38.100 --> 37:39.140
Senior Xie.

37:40.300 --> 37:41.140
It's me.

37:41.940 --> 37:42.980
Senior Xie.

37:43.540 --> 37:44.670
I'm here to save you.

37:53.220 --> 37:55.580
You finally came.

38:11.260 --> 38:11.820
Luo Ge!

38:12.930 --> 38:13.700
You are hurt?

38:14.300 --> 38:14.830
I'm fine.

38:14.900 --> 38:15.450
How is it?

38:15.780 --> 38:17.110
Have you got Sun Spring?

38:22.020 --> 38:23.300
Yes. Let's retreat.

38:24.020 --> 38:24.490
Okay.

38:24.940 --> 38:26.470
I know there is a safe place.

38:26.540 --> 38:27.300
Follow me.

38:28.260 --> 38:28.790
Let's go.

38:57.020 --> 38:57.660
Senior.

39:00.700 --> 39:02.060
Do I look ugly?

39:03.220 --> 39:03.820
No.

39:05.340 --> 39:06.400
You look so pretty.

39:08.610 --> 39:09.070
Come on.

39:09.500 --> 39:10.760
I'll take you to Luo Ge.

39:11.940 --> 39:13.470
He is the current Immortal.

39:14.500 --> 39:15.060
Come on.

39:18.380 --> 39:19.580
Immortal should be able to deal with those

39:19.580 --> 39:20.840
demonized disciples.

39:22.300 --> 39:23.960
Why was he seriously injured?

39:24.180 --> 39:26.980
It should be caused by Yin-yang Power in this cave.

39:27.100 --> 39:27.830
Don't worry.

39:28.860 --> 39:30.700
I observed the terrain here just now,

39:30.700 --> 39:32.360
and set up formations around.

39:32.540 --> 39:34.670
That cost me a little immortal energy.

39:37.220 --> 39:37.750
Liu Shao.

39:38.580 --> 39:39.140
Liu Shao.

39:39.420 --> 39:40.060
Her immortal energy

39:40.060 --> 39:41.740
was severely eroded by Moon Poison,

39:41.740 --> 39:43.540
so she had to take Sun Spring immediately.

39:43.540 --> 39:45.460
Otherwise she would completely lose her mind

39:45.460 --> 39:46.990
just like those disciples.

39:48.660 --> 39:50.500
Our spiritual powers are working against each other.

39:50.500 --> 39:51.560
If this continues,

39:51.740 --> 39:52.940
we will never get out.

39:53.020 --> 39:53.660
No.

39:54.020 --> 39:55.420
The disciples in the cave will come soon

39:55.420 --> 39:56.540
once they smell Sun Spring.

39:56.540 --> 39:58.140
You have no time to refine it.

39:58.340 --> 39:59.540
We must get out first.

40:11.650 --> 40:13.330
Sealing this Moon Bell inside her body

40:13.330 --> 40:15.850
can temporarily protect her immortal energy.

40:15.850 --> 40:17.250
Xie Lingqi, lead the way.

40:19.980 --> 40:21.300
We've been here for too long.

40:21.300 --> 40:23.260
Now we need to find that crack as soon as possible.

40:23.260 --> 40:24.300
If we delay a little longer

40:24.300 --> 40:25.900
we will not be able to get out.

40:26.620 --> 40:28.220
I am affected by Yin-yang Power

40:28.220 --> 40:30.150
and cannot use water energy at all.

40:30.740 --> 40:31.340
Luo Ge,

40:31.980 --> 40:33.240
we're counting on you.

40:33.660 --> 40:34.740
Immortal

40:35.060 --> 40:36.300
should be able to barely open this boundary

40:36.300 --> 40:37.490
